  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting  the Establishment of a Regional Training Centre on Migration in Azerbaijan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to contribute to better migration management and regional cooperation in Azerbaijan, the Commonwealth of Independent States (CIS) countries and beyond, through the establishment of a Regional Training Centre on Migration (RTCM) in Azerbaijan. In order to achieve the project objective and related outcomes, the project will conduct an assessment of the existing training capacities and needs in Azerbaijan and targeted countries. Based on the findings of the assessment, the project will support its partner agencies in developing a roadmap for the establishment of the RTCM. The project will support the initial steps in facilitating the implementation of the roadmap through developing a regional training curriculum on migration and setting up an e-library at the RTCM. A regional pool of trainers will also be established who will further cascade the training in Azerbaijan and two other partnering CIS countries.</narrative>
  </description>
